# GatherPack

> <%= site.data.site_metadata.definition %>

GatherPack is MIT-licensed (SPDX: MIT) and maintained by Sledgehammer Infosystems. Founded around a FIRST Robotics team's operational needs (predecessor in production since 2014, GatherPack since 2024). In production today: 2 orgs live, 6 evaluating.

- Site: https://gatherpack.com
- GitHub: https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack
- Discord: https://discord.gg/r3fmNDVn3N
- Contact: https://gatherpack.com/contact/
- License: https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack/blob/main/LICENSE

## Features

- Members & Teams: searchable roster, relationships, badges, hierarchy, managers and permissions — /features/members/
- Events: team-scoped calendar, RSVPs, shift sign-ups, check-in, time-clock kiosk (PIN/barcode/RFID), periods and bulk clock-out — /features/events/
- Finance: simple ledger, tagged transactions, receipts/invoices, Stripe payments (cards, bank transfer); Zeffy/PayPal/Venmo and bank-pull on roadmap — /features/finance/
- Communication: team-scoped announcements with scheduled publish/expire, email digests, content pages; text/Slack/Discord and unified notifications on roadmap — /features/communication/
- Automation: custom reports, time-tracking reports; Actions (user-triggered) and Hooks (event-driven) plus no-code builder on roadmap — /features/automation/

More: /features/ — hub linking all five pillars with screenshots and proof.

## Self-Host vs Managed Hosting

- Self-Host Free: MIT license, $0 + Stripe fees and your server. Full source at https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack, same features. You handle server, updates, backups, Stripe setup. Community via GitHub/Discord.
- Managed Standard: $50/mo via Sledgehammer Infosystems — hosting, updates, backups, support, Stripe integration included.
- Managed Custom: $100/mo + plugin development — when you need workflow-specific extensions.

Comparison table and philosophy: /open-source/ (canonical; alias /self-hosting → /open-source/) and /hosting/ (canonical; alias /pricing → /hosting/). Two orgs live on GatherPack today. FIRST Robotics teams receive a significant discount.

## Who It's For

- FIRST Robotics teams (FRC/FTC) — build season, competition, shop time-clock — /use-cases/first-robotics/ (redirect: /first-teams → /use-cases/first-robotics/)
- Nonprofits and community orgs — volunteers, grants, service hours — /use-cases/nonprofits/
- Churches and congregations — families, small groups, giving — /use-cases/churches/
- Youth clubs (scouts, 4-H, after-school) — families, dues, schedules — /use-cases/youth-clubs/
- Sports leagues — divisions, teams, games, fees, announcements — /use-cases/sports-leagues/

All five use cases follow the same roster→events→finance→communication→reports core, scoped by teams.

